{"id":"orch-p3-actions","parent":"feat-orch","ord":"a8","title":"PR: actions — the procedure registry's first verbs (phase 3)","todo":true,"desc":"dispatch (with merge=auto|human set at dispatch), kill/retire, mute, approve (approved=<time>), re-dispatch, bounce; chat \"about this lane\" (a composer deep-link — the lane is a reference, not a session). instructions.md drops dispatch and retirement. From here on the driver runs as its own process (`olai orchestrate`) holding every dangerous capability; the web server stays read-and-derive.","after":["orch-p2-events"],"created":"2026-08-25T16:56:00-04:00","changed":"2026-08-26T10:42:52-04:00"}
{"id":"orch-p4-prinfo","parent":"orch-kolu","ord":"a3","title":"kolu: PrInfo grows reviewDecision + mergeStateStatus #upstream","done":"2026-08-25T18:45:17-04:00","desc":"Two --json fields on the same `gh pr view` the sensor already runs. Without them the review-posted and mergeable gates have no mechanical predicate. Ruled: no interim gh in olai, no interim event-shaped review gate — the gates PR waits.","created":"2026-08-25T16:56:00-04:00","changed":"2026-08-26T10:40:47-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/ppf.md","dispatched":"2026-08-25T17:03:00-04:00","merge":"merge-human","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/kolu/commit/639ab4aa26a4f07bfade279b60aedbbff714d373","merged":"2026-08-25T18:40:00-04:00","repo":"repo-kolu","worktree":"~/code/kolu/.worktrees/prinfo-fields"}}
