{"id":"ptc-implement","parent":"orch-p0-thin-client","ord":"a0","title":"the extraction + /be + /ci (kolu's own process) + open PR","done":"2026-08-25T22:50:27-04:00","desc":"The /be interview's rulings (answered by the orchestrator at dispatch, 17:06): package = `@kolu/padi-client` (closure 33→21 packages — kaval, node-pty, xterm, the whole daemon+TUI tier dropped); blast radius = rewrite every site (~190 imports, ~6 manifests — no re-export barrels); scope = spec + dial core + watch kit (surface/chrome/terminal vocabs, transcriptSchema, dial-core, rendezvous, watch — dialPadiViaHost/discovery/watchSpec stay daemon-side); debate peer = grok (proven working today; codex untested here, pi's provider down).\n\nAMENDED at 20:25 (3h23m total) after the consumer's two gap findings: both closed as CHECKS (closure test asserts reached ENTRIES not packages; osfacts-client vendoring fixed — the manifest change touches a drishti-gated package, shipped with no-API-delta reasoning in the body for the human to overrule); the consumer's gap-2 diagnosis corrected (value imports through the supervisor barrel, not just vocab.ts's reach); a real HIGH js/file-system-race on the PR's own cache fixed with a single file handle. Green at b77444e2 (49 checks, both platforms). FOR THE HUMAN in the body: the socket-path-guess/read-back split (mitigated via $PADI_SOCKET; the non-forking fix is a drishti-gated two-repo lockstep, out of scope), and the drishti-manifest judgment call. Merge order stands: this after the olai consumer compiles, then re-pin, then terminal-door.","created":"2026-08-25T16:59:54-04:00","changed":"2026-08-25T22:50:27-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"f4a1e372"}}
